==Trivia==
*Most of the files for the Underground Labyrinth were added in [[Version 11.10 Update|Version 11.10]], where there were 104 total stages including placeholders. Additionally, they were completely blacked out to prevent any spoilers.
**3 stages were later removed in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]], leaving 101 total stages as a result.
**[[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]] added 11 new stages to the Labyrinth.
**[[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]] added 1 new stage and the map name for 1 new floor.
*The [https://youtu.be/wljzxSv9rNk first music track] exclusive to the Underground Labyrinth sounds similar to "[https://youtu.be/USlwK2QHz_0 Monsters in the Dungeon]" (also known as "Deep Underground") from the ''[https://dragon-quest.org/wiki/Dragon_Quest_V:_Hand_of_the_Heavenly_Bride Dragon Quest V]'' soundtrack.
*[[Grand Mage Mimon]]'s description reveals that she is the one who traps units in the Underground Labyrinth, forcing them to listen to her long, rambling stories about her [[Dark Priest Mamon|big brother]].

